===Format===
[[File:RLCS Swiss Format.jpg|thumbnail|335px|A graphical explanation of the Swiss System format]]
*'''Swiss Stage''' - ''September 10th - 13th, 2024''
** 16 Team Swiss System Format.
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo5}}.
** <span class="bg-up">Top 8</span> Teams proceed to the [[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2024#Playoffs|Playoffs]].
<br>
* '''Swiss Tiebreaker''' - ''September 14th, 2024''
** Teams finishing 3rd-5th in the [[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2024#Swiss Stage|Swiss Stage]] play out a tiebreaker to determine the seeding within those 3 positions.
**Team that finished 3rd plays the 4th seed. The loser of that plays the 5th seed.
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo5}}.
<br>
*'''Playoffs''' - ''September 14th - 15th, 2024''
**AFL Final Eight system
**Top 4 of the [[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2024#Swiss Stage|Swiss Stage]] start with two chances before the Final Four, whereas teams ranked 5th-8th start with one chance.
***All matches are {{Abbr/Bo7}}.


''Crowd Days: September 13th - 15th''

